# Game DNS block (r3s-policy-evaluator). Applies to devices in the groups set
# by 'option game_dns_groups' in /etc/config/r3s-accounting; a device on
# Telegram /game is left out until its game time ends.
#
#   block DOMAIN   AdGuard Home answers 0.0.0.0 for DOMAIN and its subdomains
#   allow DOMAIN   exception (still resolves), e.g. update downloads
#
# '*' may appear inside a label. Changes apply on the next evaluator run.

# War Thunder / Gaijin: sign-in (auth.gaijinent.com, login.gaijin.net),
# lobby (mgate-*.warthunder.com), profile (char-*.warthunder.com), chat.
block warthunder.com
block gaijin.net
block gaijinent.com
block gaijin.ru
# Update downloads keep working, so game time is not spent downloading.
allow cdn.gaijin.net
allow aws-yup-distr-*.gaijinent.com
allow cdnnow-distr.gaijinent.com
allow dldata-aws.warthunder.com

# Steam and Counter-Strike 2: without Steam sign-in (steamserver.net CMs,
# steampowered.com, steamcommunity.com) CS2 cannot start online play.
block steampowered.com
block steamcommunity.com
block steamserver.net
block steamstatic.com
block steamcontent.com
block steamusercontent.com
block steam-chat.com
block valvesoftware.com
block counter-strike.net
